{"seq":9,"slug":"habit-engineering","title":"习惯工程","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-systems","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"习惯工程\">习惯工程</h1><p>习惯工程是个人系统（personal-systems）知识集群中的一个核心 hub，专注于「如何有意识地设计、建立和维持有益于你的行为模式」。它不关心「你应该养成什么习惯」——那取决于你的价值观和目标——它关心的是「一旦你确定了想要的行为，如何用科学的方法让它持续发生」。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界如下：量化自我（quantified-self）聚焦于「测量什么、如何测量」，提供数据采集和分析的工具与方法；数字极简主义（digital-minimalism）聚焦于「与技术建立健康关系」，提供数字环境清理和注意力管理的策略；个人知识管理（knowledge-management-pkm）聚焦于「知识的获取、组织和输出」。习惯工程与这三者都有交集但各有侧重：它用量化自我的测量方法来追踪习惯进度，用数字极简主义的环境清理来减少坏习惯的触发，但它的核心命题是「行为如何被设计和维持」——这是其他 hub 不深入展开的。</p>\n<p>本 hub 的四条主线按「从理论到实践、从建立到维持」递进排列：行为科学基础（理解习惯为什么会形成、环境为什么比意志力重要、动机为什么不可靠）→ 设计系统（如何设计触发、简化行为、构建奖励反馈）→ 实践方法（习惯叠加、身份认同、打破坏习惯的具体技术）→ 持续与度量（追踪系统、环境再设计、长期保持策略）。建议按此顺序阅读，因为每一章都建立在前一章的概念基础上。如果你只关心「怎么做」，可以从第三章实践方法开始，但第一章和第二章的科学背景会帮助你理解为什么这些方法有效，从而更灵活地应用它们。</p>\n<p>前置知识：不需要特定的学术背景。本 hub 面向有自我提升意愿、愿意花时间理解行为科学原理并将其应用到日常生活中的读者。如果你熟悉心理学或神经科学的基本概念，阅读会更顺畅，但这不是必需的——所有关键概念都会在首次出现时给出解释。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：量化自我 hub 提供了更深入的自我追踪技术，数字极简主义 hub 提供了数字环境清理的系统方法，个人自动化（personal-automation）hub 展示了如何用自动化工具减少行为的启动摩擦。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"behavior-science","title":"行为科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/behavior-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"habit-formation","title":"习惯形成机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/behavior-science/habit-formation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"environment-design","title":"环境设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/behavior-science/environment-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"motivation-willpower","title":"动机与意志力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/behavior-science/motivation-willpower"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-systems","title":"设计系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/design-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trigger-cue-design","title":"触发与提示设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/design-systems/trigger-cue-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"behavior-simplification","title":"行为简化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/design-systems/behavior-simplification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reward-feedback-loops","title":"奖励与反馈循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/design-systems/reward-feedback-loops"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"practical-methods","title":"实践方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/practical-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"habit-stacking","title":"习惯叠加与链接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/practical-methods/habit-stacking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"identity-habits","title":"身份认同与习惯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/practical-methods/identity-habits"},{"seq":3,"slug":"breaking-bad-habits","title":"打破坏习惯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/practical-methods/breaking-bad-habits"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sustainment-measurement","title":"持续与度量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/sustainment-measurement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"habit-tracking","title":"习惯追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/sustainment-measurement/habit-tracking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"environment-redesign","title":"环境再设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/sustainment-measurement/environment-redesign"},{"seq":3,"slug":"long-term-retention","title":"长期保持策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/habit-engineering/sustainment-measurement/long-term-retention"}]}]}